[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2752386\">0010T84</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752825\">4450B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753309\">7055B90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753310\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753303\">7055A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753353\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the drier filter mounting\nbracket (1b).</p><p>2. Undo the drier filter and remove it.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2064805.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the drier filter and tighten\nit in place.</p><p>Fit the filter mounting bracket and tighten\nthe fixing bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753353\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753303\">7055A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753310\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753309\">7055B90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752825\">4450B02</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752386\">0010T84</a></p>"]]